{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"The first focused run found a sequencing issue: the linker test helpers now use `derive`, while production’s pairing verifier still uses the old register allocator until 8c. I’ll keep that test’s pairing inputs on the current production path. The run also found four H pins missing from the plan and a projection root that must be recomputed with its new child hashes; both are being added to the reproduction script."}}
